PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tax/returns/{{returnId}}/amend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amendment_reason": "Incorrect gross income figure. Corrected based on updated bank statement."
}


### Audit Log

### 1. Get Audit Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit-log?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}



### Notifications

### 1. Register FCM Device Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fcm_token": "fcm-device-token-here",
  "device_info": "Pixel 8 Pro / Android 15",
  "platform": "android"
}

### 2. Unregister FCM Device Token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "fcm_token": "fcm-device-token-here"
}

### 3. Get Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Get Unread Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Get Single Notification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Mark One Notification as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Mark All Notifications as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Delete a Notification
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Clear All Notifications
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Get Notification Preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Update Notification Preferences
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "deadline_reminders": true,
  "penalty_alerts": true,
  "vault_suggestions": false,
  "referral_offers": false,
  "payment_confirmations": true,
  "system_updates": true
}




### GROUP 20: INVOICES

### 1. Get All Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get All Invoices (filtered by status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices?status=unpaid&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Get Invoice Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Create Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "client_name": "Sitsofe Nkrumah",
  "client_email": "exl.mayres@gmail.com",
  "client_phone": "+233551448215",
  "description": "Web development services - May 2026",
  "subtotal": 8000.00,
  "due_date": "2026-06-15"
}

### 5. Get Single Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Update Invoice
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "client_name": "Sitsofe Nkrumah",
  "description": "Web development services - May 2026 (maintenance)",
  "subtotal": 15000.00,
  "due_date": "2026-06-20"
}

### 7. Mark Invoice as Paid
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/paid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{}

### 8. Cancel Invoice
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "reason": "Client requested cancellation"
}

### 9. Get Invoice PDF URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Send Invoice via WhatsApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "channel": "whatsapp"
}

### 11. Send Invoice via Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "channel": "email"
}

### 12. Send Invoice via Download
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "channel": "download"
}

### 13. Download Invoice PDF (public — no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/pdf/download


###GROUP 23: REFERRAL OFFERS

### 1. Get All Referral Offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get Referral Offers (filtered by type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals?offer_type=loan&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Check Eligibility
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/check-eligibility
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Mark Offer as Viewed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/viewed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Mark Offer as Clicked (returns deep link)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/clicked
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Dismiss Offer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/referrals/{{referralId}}/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

