{
  "partner_reference": "FIDO-REF-2026-001",
  "product_name": "SME Business Loan",
  "amount": 15000.00
}


### GROUP 8: TRANSACTIONS

### 1. Get All Transactions (no filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get Transactions (filtered by type)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?type=income&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Get Transactions (filtered by category and date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?category=sales_income&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-12-31&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Get Transactions (tax deductible expenses only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?type=expense&tax_deductible=true&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Create Transaction (income)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "category": "sales_income",
  "description": "Payment from client for website design",
  "tax_deductible": false,
  "withholding_applicable": false,
  "transaction_date": "2026-05-28"
}

### 6. Create Transaction (expense with withholding)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 2000.00,
  "category": "services",
  "description": "Consulting fee received",
  "tax_deductible": false,
  "withholding_applicable": true,
  "transaction_date": "2026-05-28"
}

### 7. Get Single Transaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Update Transaction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "amount": 5500.00,
  "description": "Payment from client for website design (revised)",
  "tax_deductible": true
}

### 9. Delete Transaction
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Validate Statement File Before Import
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/import/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="provider"

mtn_momo
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

date,description,credit,debit
2026-01-15,Payment from Kwame,500.00,
2026-01-17,Office rent,,200.00
2026-01-20,Transfer from savings,300.00,
------FormBoundary--

### 11. Import Statement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="provider"

mtn_momo
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="statement_from"

2026-01-01
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="statement_to"

2026-01-31
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="momo_jan2026.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

date,description,credit,debit
2026-01-15,Payment from Kwame,500.00,
2026-01-17,Office rent,,200.00
2026-01-20,Commission received,300.00,
------FormBoundary--

### 12. Get Import History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/import/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


